        <footnote id="F1">Pursuant to the Agreement and Plan of Merger, dated as of August 10, 2026 (the &quot;Merger Agreement&quot;), by and among Bowman Consulting Group Ltd. (the &quot;Company&quot;), Prive Parent, Inc. (&quot;Parent&quot;), and Prive Merger Sub, Inc. (&quot;Merger Sub&quot;), a wholly owned subsidiary of Parent, on November 6, 2026, Merger Sub merged with and into the Company (the &quot;Merger&quot;), with the Company continuing as the surviving corporation, and each share of Company common stock, par value $0.01 per share (each, a &quot;Share&quot;), outstanding immediately prior to the effective time of the Merger (the &quot;Effective Time&quot;) (other than certain excluded Shares) was automatically canceled and converted into the right to receive $43.00 in cash, without interest and subject to any applicable tax withholding (the &quot;Merger Consideration&quot;).</footnote>
