        <footnote id="F3">Immediately prior to the Effective Time, each outstanding Company restricted stock award (each, an &quot;RSA&quot;) granted to the Reporting Person became fully vested and free of restrictions and were subsequently canceled and converted, in accordance with the terms of the Merger Agreement, into the right to receive, in respect of each Share subject to such RSA, the Merger Consideration in cash, without interest.</footnote>
